              "value": 17
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You have reconfigured the magical resonance of your core to attune to the planar energies of Axis. You can cast plane shift twice per week as an arcane innate spell that can only target yourself; you can travel only to Axis or the Material Plane, and your body serves as the focus component."
